Step by step instructions (windows)

Recommend to use virtual environment 
> i use venv so 
> python -m venv <name>
> <name>/scripts/activate

1. Install this to PATH. This is for pytesseract. 
https://github.com/UB-Mannheim/tesseract/wiki

2. Run python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Open hytale full screen

4. Click F7 twice to show the coordinates at the right

4. Run python -m main in the directory (just alt-tab)

5. Have fun (probably because u might encounter ocr bugs)
